    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="19">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Cn1020">Cn 1020</ref> 19</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">⁊ ealle men, earme ⁊ eadige, heora cyrcan secean ⁊ for heora synnum þingian ⁊ ælc beboden fæsten geornlice healdan ⁊ þa halgan georne weorðian þe us mæssepreostas beodan sceolan.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And all men, both rich and poor, shall attend their churches and make supplication for their sins, and zealously keep every prescribed fast, and diligently celebrate the saints-days which the priests enjoin upon us.</ab>
      </div>
